flowchart LR
  msg["1. A Slack message reaches your clone"]
  judge["2. The clone reads the thread and judges the request"]

  msg --> judge

  judge --> refused["3. Staging, production or a release, or someone else's code without their approval"]
  judge --> question["4. A question one read settles"]
  judge --> own["5. Your own change to a Doc, Sheet, ticket or page"]
  judge --> research["6. Research: a worker investigates"]
  judge --> work["7. Work: a worker carries it out"]

  refused --> said["A refusal, or what their side needs"]

  question --> answer["A marked answer naming what it read"]
  question --> passed["The rest goes to you, when the asker may not ask for work"]

  own --> changed["The clone makes the change and says what changed"]

  research --> report["An answer from the report, with sources and doubts"]
  research --> blocked["Blocked: the connection to reconnect, or the missing tool or access"]

  work --> pr["An open pull request"]
  work --> merged["Merged, where workers may merge"]
  work --> result["The result, said once in the thread"]
  work --> waits["A step waits on a missing contract or value, the rest goes on"]
  work --> stops["Stopped by you, or failed twice: the clone says so"]
  work --> ask["One short question to you"]
